# live Govee/IMAP account: TESTED (bundles under proof/live-2fa/)
# Govee device hardware: NOT TESTED

This PR adds the harness that produced the evidence cited by the 2FA
email-request PR. It ships no user-facing behaviour change: the
`live-2fa-test` cargo feature is off by default and `scripts/build-cross.sh`
builds `--release` with no `--features`, so neither the `undoc live2fa-login`
probe nor the `GOVEE_LIVE_2FA_NO_DOTENV` dotenv bypass is compiled into any
released binary or add-on image.

